# Intentionally declares nothing.
#
# tests/dryRun.test.js points the CLI child's dotenv here via
# DOTENV_CONFIG_PATH, so `import 'dotenv/config'` loads this instead of the
# repo root's .env. Without it the child inherits whatever keys a developer
# box happens to hold, and the "without API keys" cases stop testing that.
#
# Keep this file empty of assignments.
